### TicketIQ API walkthrough for the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
### Click "Send Request" above each block, top to bottom. Start the app first.
@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Sign in as the agent (copy the accessToken into the variable below)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "agent@ticketiq.local", "password": "12345678", "role": "AGENT" }

###
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### 2. Create a ticket (the AI triages it in the background)
POST {{base}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Reset email is not arriving", "description": "I pressed Forgot password but the email never arrives. Call me on 9876543210." }

### 3. List tickets (filters: status, category, priority, q, page, size)
GET {{base}}/api/tickets?status=TRIAGED&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. One ticket, including the AI block (agents and admins only)
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/16
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Similar past tickets
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/16/similar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Suggested reply with sources
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/16/suggested-reply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Manual triage (always overrides the AI)
PATCH {{base}}/api/tickets/16/triage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "category": "ACCESS", "priority": "HIGH" }

### 8. Tell us whether the AI draft helped
POST {{base}}/api/tickets/16/ai-feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accepted": true, "edited": false }

### 9. Comment (set internal true for an agent-only note)
POST {{base}}/api/tickets/16/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "We have resent the link.", "internal": false }

### 10. Resolve (needs a resolution; this also teaches the AI)
PATCH {{base}}/api/tickets/16/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "RESOLVED", "resolution": "Mail gateway was filtering the reset email. Allowed the sender and resent." }

### 11. Ask the AI to look at a ticket again
POST {{base}}/api/tickets/16/retriage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Insights
GET {{base}}/api/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
